Package: novaos-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NovaOS Project <novaos@localhost>
Depends: novaos-base, novaos-browser, plasma-desktop, plasma-workspace, kwin-wayland | kwin-x11, sddm, sddm-theme-breeze, plymouth, plymouth-label, fonts-inter, fonts-hack, python3, dpkg (>= 1.17.14)
Recommends: firefox-esr, dolphin, konsole, kcalc, haruna, gwenview, plasma-widgets-addons, kdeplasma-addons-data
Description: NovaOS desktop design (KDE Plasma 6)
 The NovaOS look and feel for KDE Plasma 6:
  * Plasma global themes "NovaOS" (light) and "NovaOS Dark"
  * Nova Light / Nova Dark colour schemes with violet accent
  * "Nova Aurora" wallpaper (light and dark variant)
  * floating panel with start menu, pinned apps, tray and clock
  * desktop widgets: calendar, CPU, memory, weather
  * NovaOS app icons, login splash, boot splash (Plymouth), login screen
  * Nova Browser (Firefox ESR) privacy policies (no telemetry)
  * upstream apps presented under NovaOS names (Nova Files, Nova Terminal, …)
